WEBVTT

00:03.210 --> 00:05.920
Grow to be a kind person, Nelia.

00:06.380 --> 00:08.170
Kinder than anyone else.

00:09.290 --> 00:12.170
I want to be the strongest in the world.

00:12.170 --> 00:14.830
Aruka is the strongest country in the world!

00:14.830 --> 00:16.750
That's what Madhart said!

00:17.130 --> 00:19.790
We are the strongest tribe
because we are Warblades!

00:19.790 --> 00:23.210
The entire world should
belong to the Warblades!

00:23.210 --> 00:24.460
Yeah!

00:24.460 --> 00:25.670
He's right!

00:25.670 --> 00:31.330
This is Yulinne Gandesblood, your tutor
and a Crimson Lord commander.

00:31.750 --> 00:33.080
Say hello.

00:34.670 --> 00:36.580
Nelia, it's nice to meet you.

00:39.250 --> 00:42.750
Nelia. You mustn't make enemies
for no reason.

00:43.540 --> 00:48.080
When you're in a tough spot,
no one will come to your aid.

00:50.420 --> 00:55.330
At that time, I didn't attempt to
understand my teacher's words.

00:58.830 --> 01:20.790
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

02:27.130 --> 02:32.500
<b>The Princess of Aruka Kingdom</b>

02:29.750 --> 02:32.500
How did this happen?!

02:32.830 --> 02:34.670
If we form an alliance with Mulnite,

02:34.670 --> 02:37.290
Heavenly Paradise will get
involved in the war!

02:37.290 --> 02:39.040
I'm definitely going to die!

02:39.630 --> 02:41.710
Terakomari Gandesblood...

02:42.000 --> 02:44.830
True to her reputation,
she is a ruthless killer!

02:45.250 --> 02:49.170
And here I was, thinking she was
actually a pacifist like me...

02:49.880 --> 02:53.250
Terakomari has an extraordinary
Core Implosion.

02:54.170 --> 02:56.830
She isn't a stupid weakling
like you, Lady Karla.

02:56.830 --> 02:58.670
You don't have to spell it out like that!

02:58.670 --> 03:03.080
After all, I'm just an idiot forced to act
as if I'm the strongest commander!

03:03.580 --> 03:05.290
What're you gonna do now?

03:05.290 --> 03:06.290
Gonna die?

03:06.290 --> 03:10.460
I hate fighting, but I have this.

03:11.580 --> 03:13.500
Sounds good in there.
Nice and empty.

03:14.130 --> 03:17.380
Emptiness is a form of its own.

03:18.040 --> 03:21.170
There are a plethora of tricks
churning in my head to keep

03:21.170 --> 03:24.170
the fires of war far from
Heavenly Paradise.

03:24.630 --> 03:26.790
Even if Mulnite is asking
for reinforcements,

03:26.790 --> 03:29.500
I should ignore them
because I'm busy right now!

03:29.500 --> 03:32.170
Lady Karla, you really are empty, huh.

03:33.210 --> 03:36.330
A pacifist puts every effort
towards avoiding war.

03:36.920 --> 03:39.710
But you have to defeat Gerra-Aruka.

03:40.170 --> 03:42.380
I know that, Koharu.

03:42.750 --> 03:45.210
A dream paradise sounds fishy.

03:45.750 --> 03:51.000
The people of Heavenly Paradise who
disappeared at the border are already there...

03:48.880 --> 03:51.880
<b>Gerra-Aruka Republic</b>

03:48.880 --> 03:51.880
<b>Presidential Executive Office</b>

03:54.830 --> 03:58.380
The Mulnite Empire and
Heavenly Paradise will join forces,

03:58.380 --> 04:02.040
and plan to destroy our
dream paradise of a country!

04:02.330 --> 04:06.710
This cannot end by simply expressing regret.

04:07.380 --> 04:09.920
Wouldn't you agree, troops?

04:12.460 --> 04:13.790
Mr. President.

04:13.790 --> 04:16.750
Won't you give me a chance
to redeem myself?

04:16.750 --> 04:18.210
I guarantee you, the next time victory wi-

04:18.210 --> 04:20.130
Dream Paradise has suffered damage

04:20.130 --> 04:24.210
due to you failing to capture her
in the first place.

04:25.080 --> 04:28.750
And you ask for another chance without
even taking responsibility for that...

04:30.130 --> 04:33.170
That's about what I would expect
from the princess of Aruka.

04:34.290 --> 04:36.210
Maybe she thinks she's
the main character in a tragedy.

04:36.210 --> 04:38.080
Why is a girl like this one of
the Eight Illustrious Generals?

04:38.080 --> 04:40.630
And she's a royal who's
oppressed the people...

04:42.580 --> 04:44.540
Nelia Cunningham.

04:44.920 --> 04:47.920
You'll be sent off to a different prison
than your father,

04:47.920 --> 04:51.540
but your rights as a royal
will all be stripped away.

04:55.580 --> 04:59.250
Nelia. Incredible blunder you made, eh?

04:59.920 --> 05:01.710
Mind your business.

05:01.710 --> 05:04.290
And could you please not touch me
with your filthy hands.

05:06.210 --> 05:10.170
Oh yes, you're much cuter when
you're pretending to be strong.

05:10.170 --> 05:13.040
Just give up on restoring the crown already.

05:13.040 --> 05:17.420
Quit being a commander and
live your life by my side in peace.

05:17.420 --> 05:18.540
I...

05:18.540 --> 05:21.250
I will not be daunted by corrupt individuals!

05:21.250 --> 05:25.710
I will make sure to expose you and
your friends' evil deeds and transform Aruka!

05:25.710 --> 05:27.880
I'm going to make mincemeat out of Madhart!

05:29.380 --> 05:32.460
The next president will be me!

05:38.330 --> 05:41.540
The very best of luck to you, Princess.

05:47.880 --> 05:49.290
Lady Nelia...

05:49.290 --> 05:51.210
I'm fine, Gertrude.

05:52.580 --> 05:54.080
Yulinne...

06:01.790 --> 06:03.710
Lady Komari, wake up.

06:03.710 --> 06:05.290
You have work to do.

06:06.540 --> 06:08.130
Work?

06:08.460 --> 06:10.330
An emergency strategy meeting.

06:10.540 --> 06:13.830
Her Majesty the Empress and
the Crimson Lords are all waiting.

06:14.580 --> 06:16.580
Tell them I overslept.

06:17.000 --> 06:19.130
There's no need to.

06:19.130 --> 06:21.250
Everyone's gathered here now.

06:21.250 --> 06:23.880
What is this nonsense you're saying?

06:36.040 --> 06:38.210
Uh, is this a dream?

06:38.630 --> 06:40.540
Since you won't wake up,

06:40.540 --> 06:43.790
we carried your bed and all to the
meeting venue and put it on a table.

06:43.790 --> 06:45.000
What the heck are you doing?!

06:45.000 --> 06:48.170
I'd like to ask the same of YOU,
Miss Gandesblood!

06:48.170 --> 06:51.920
It's outrageous that you're fast asleep
on the table in our meeting area!

06:52.380 --> 06:53.790
She's not wrong...

06:54.040 --> 06:55.960
Morning, Komari.

06:56.330 --> 06:58.540
Have a seat in a chair.

06:58.540 --> 07:00.170
Er, ah, sure...

07:00.460 --> 07:02.630
Lady Komari, here you go.

07:03.540 --> 07:07.130
Say Vill, this is the Mulnite Palace, right?

07:07.130 --> 07:08.170
No.

07:08.170 --> 07:09.920
This is Faure, the fortress city.

07:09.920 --> 07:13.540
You really brought me to a place like that
while I was sleeping?

07:13.540 --> 07:15.960
So, what's this meeting about?

07:16.420 --> 07:20.830
A proclamation from Gerra-Aruka has arrived,
so it's a strategy meeting about that.

07:22.710 --> 07:26.750
Official notice to the Mul-Heav Alliance
Leader Terakomari Gandesblood,

07:26.750 --> 07:29.460
from the President of the
Gerra-Aruka Republic.

07:29.460 --> 07:30.250
Huh?

07:30.250 --> 07:32.500
The reckless action of your alliance,

07:32.500 --> 07:35.540
especially the behavior of Commander
Terakomari Gandesblood,

07:35.540 --> 07:38.080
was deemed a threat against the Six Nations.

07:38.630 --> 07:43.210
Accordingly, our country will
declare war on the Mul-Heav Alliance.

07:43.670 --> 07:45.290
Does that mean we're going to war?

07:45.290 --> 07:46.290
Yes.

07:47.580 --> 07:49.330
And is that, perhaps, my fault?

07:49.500 --> 07:51.540
You only pulled the trigger.

07:52.040 --> 07:54.290
It was only a matter of time
before an outbreak of war.

07:54.290 --> 07:56.920
How did I become the alliance leader?

07:57.330 --> 07:59.920
Because pictures like this are circulating.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.750
What the heck is that?! Alliance Leader?

08:02.750 --> 08:04.710
What does an alliance leader even do?!

08:04.710 --> 08:05.710
They slaughter.

08:05.710 --> 08:07.290
You know I want nothing to do with that!

08:07.290 --> 08:09.880
And I was gonna sneak down
to hang out by pool today, too!

08:10.330 --> 08:14.040
I would've loved to join you on that,
but Lady Komari...

08:14.040 --> 08:15.130
Huh?

08:16.460 --> 08:18.460
You've got everyone's attention.

08:22.250 --> 08:24.380
And I was gonna sneak down and

08:24.380 --> 08:27.080
make a pool from the blood of
enemy soldiers to hang out by, too!

08:27.080 --> 08:28.880
And there you have it!

08:28.880 --> 08:32.670
It seems our leader is eager
to pulverize the enemy.

08:32.960 --> 08:34.330
I can't see.

08:34.330 --> 08:37.040
It's hard to say that this is different from
our usual entertainment war.

08:37.040 --> 08:38.880
According to information from scouts,

08:38.880 --> 08:42.710
almost all of Gerra-Aruka's Eight Illustrious
Generals are actually on the move.

08:42.710 --> 08:43.500
Eh?

08:43.500 --> 08:48.420
There's no doubt the enemy is aiming for here,
the fortress city of Faure, right?

08:48.420 --> 08:50.210
If this place is captured,

08:50.210 --> 08:54.880
it could easily be transferred to a place
in the Mulnite Empire or Heavenly Paradise.

08:54.880 --> 08:55.960
What?!

08:56.420 --> 08:59.000
There are two aims to our campaign.

08:59.000 --> 09:02.250
Decimate the enemies that are
advancing on us here.

09:02.250 --> 09:06.080
And the other, demolish the
enemy's military base.

09:06.380 --> 09:07.670
Karla Amatsu.

09:09.790 --> 09:14.380
The resort area Gerra-Aruka constructed in
the Dark Core Zone, Daydream Paradise.

09:14.830 --> 09:17.540
According to information
acquired by my country's ninjas,

09:17.540 --> 09:22.040
there's evidence that a large volume of illegal
ritual articles was brought to this land.

09:22.460 --> 09:25.960
If we get that proof and
reveal it all to the Six Nations,

09:25.960 --> 09:29.580
President Madhart may decide
that they can't go to war.

09:29.580 --> 09:33.130
This time, if the enemy intends to
make use of the ritual article,

09:33.130 --> 09:35.040
we have to go all out.

09:35.500 --> 09:38.670
If those articles are stolen by enemies
in a large-scale war,

09:38.670 --> 09:41.040
it would be us in jeopardy.

09:41.420 --> 09:43.420
There's zero chance they'll use it.

09:43.420 --> 09:45.420
I see, indeed.

09:45.420 --> 09:49.210
However, carelessness may prove fatal.

09:50.880 --> 09:54.080
In any case, the eight commanders present

09:54.080 --> 09:58.380
will split into offensive and defensive teams
and move on to our strategy.

09:58.380 --> 10:01.250
Oh, we don't need to count Petrose in on this.

10:01.790 --> 10:04.540
Petrose is one of the
Seven Crimson Lords, right?

10:04.540 --> 10:06.040
Why aren't they here?

10:06.040 --> 10:10.670
They are acting on their own authority
and already fighting.

10:10.960 --> 10:13.290
We live in totally different worlds, don't we?

10:13.290 --> 10:14.290
Miss Komari!

10:14.290 --> 10:14.920
Huh?

10:28.210 --> 10:30.170
Aw, man...

10:32.960 --> 10:35.670
That's the Gerra-Aruka Republic's 4th Unit,

10:35.670 --> 10:37.170
and... 1st Unit!

10:37.170 --> 10:39.130
More and more and transferring here!

10:39.130 --> 10:42.460
Th-the city is surrounded! This is bad!

10:42.460 --> 10:46.080
Of course it is!
They're declaring war over there!

10:46.420 --> 10:49.460
What's the next step, Mul-Heav Alliance?!

11:01.830 --> 11:03.670
Now they've done it.

11:14.540 --> 11:18.750
How do you do, Your Majesty,
Empress of the Mulnite Empire?

11:18.750 --> 11:21.420
Is this President Madhart?

11:21.920 --> 11:24.670
What is your goal here? Spill it.

11:24.960 --> 11:29.130
Our goal is to conquer the Mulnite Empire...

11:29.130 --> 11:33.540
is what I'd like to say,
but I'm not that much of a fiend.

11:34.130 --> 11:37.750
When you tell us the true nature of
the Mulnite Empire's Dark Core,

11:37.750 --> 11:39.000
I'll withdraw the troops.

11:39.330 --> 11:42.330
For the sake of peace in the Six Nations,

11:42.330 --> 11:45.750
we have joined forces with the Haku-Goku
Commonwealth and the Lapelico Kingdom.

11:45.750 --> 11:48.670
Sooner or later, The Enchanted Lands
will also join us.

11:48.670 --> 11:51.080
Though you are the Mulnite Empire,

11:51.080 --> 11:53.380
you can't have the other
four nations as your allies.

11:53.380 --> 11:54.250
Surrender, while you still can.

11:54.250 --> 11:56.210
I have nothing to say to you.
Surrender, while you still can.<b></b>

11:56.210 --> 11:56.540
I have nothing to say to you.

11:56.880 --> 11:57.920
What?

11:58.330 --> 12:02.130
You plan to pursue us with
what you've got now? What a joke.

12:02.130 --> 12:04.000
What a disappointing bluff.

12:04.000 --> 12:07.330
You're currently in the executive office of
the president in the capital city, right?

12:07.330 --> 12:08.750
And what about it?

12:08.750 --> 12:11.830
You have been granted only two choices.

12:11.830 --> 12:13.880
Petrose, use the explosives.

12:13.880 --> 12:16.710
Explosives? What are you saying? You stupid-

12:21.710 --> 12:23.960
Now, everyone, this is war!

12:23.960 --> 12:25.750
Those who take us lightly will die,

12:25.750 --> 12:28.210
is the way we do things in the
Mulnite Empire, after all!

12:29.580 --> 12:31.670
Hey, hey, hey, hey now,

12:31.670 --> 12:35.210
the magic barrier for the office of the
president is completely gone, you know.

12:35.880 --> 12:38.540
That Petrose Calamaria is really something.

12:38.540 --> 12:40.170
Indeed.

12:40.170 --> 12:44.330
It looks like the Mulnite Empire
seriously intends to go to war.

12:54.540 --> 12:57.750
Crap! The whole city is being destroyed!

12:58.210 --> 13:00.380
Let's hurry and join up with the 7th unit.

13:00.380 --> 13:01.210
Whoa!

13:01.210 --> 13:03.330
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

13:03.330 --> 13:04.210
Huh?!

13:06.540 --> 13:07.880
Flöte?!

13:09.250 --> 13:11.500
I can't stand the sight of you,
so hurry up and go!

13:13.580 --> 13:17.000
Ugh, why do I have to be
part of the defense team...

13:25.290 --> 13:27.210
A bold attempt.

13:30.790 --> 13:32.420
Not bad.

13:32.420 --> 13:34.710
Those Seven Crimson Lords are remarkable.

13:38.250 --> 13:40.710
Greetings to the ignorant masses!

13:40.710 --> 13:43.790
I am the strongest of the Haku-Goku
Commonwealth's Six Arctic Masters!

13:43.920 --> 13:47.000
I am Her Excellency, Prohellya Butchersky!

13:43.920 --> 13:47.000
<b>Haku-Goku Commonwealth Six Arctic Masters</b>

13:43.920 --> 13:47.000
<b>Prohellya Butchersky</b>

13:47.290 --> 13:50.880
Now go, my dear Sapphires!

13:50.880 --> 13:54.710
Butcher those swine and let's raise
our morale with the first blood!

13:55.290 --> 13:56.500
Yeah!

13:56.500 --> 13:58.380
Ooh, here they come!

14:04.710 --> 14:06.790
We're done for, we're gonna die!

14:06.790 --> 14:08.460
I wanna go home!

14:11.210 --> 14:12.290
Ouch!

14:12.290 --> 14:14.330
Stop freaking out and take a ton of pictures!

14:14.330 --> 14:16.250
Melca, you're such a meanie...

14:18.830 --> 14:20.290
What's this smell?!

14:22.290 --> 14:25.540
They're going to destroy everything
with their necks until they break!

14:26.290 --> 14:31.080
It's Lieutenant General Neckson McLongo,
from Lapelico Kingdom's 2nd Unit!

14:31.960 --> 14:33.210
What the hell is that?!

14:33.210 --> 14:35.880
I'll never experience the zoo
with an innocent heart again!

14:35.880 --> 14:38.710
Die!

14:39.460 --> 14:42.130
Take this!

14:49.500 --> 14:52.380
Lady Komari, give this button a press.

14:52.380 --> 14:53.330
What is this?

14:53.830 --> 14:55.790
Don't worry about it, just press it.

14:55.790 --> 14:56.880
Okay.

15:05.580 --> 15:07.040
What was that?

15:07.040 --> 15:08.000
A landmine.

15:08.000 --> 15:09.830
Why are there landmines?!

15:09.830 --> 15:11.460
I put them there.

15:11.460 --> 15:13.380
Our allies are getting caught in them!

15:13.380 --> 15:15.000
A minor issue.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.250
Miss Komari!

15:16.540 --> 15:17.880
Sakuna!

15:17.880 --> 15:19.170
Sorry I'm late.

15:21.290 --> 15:25.830
A large amount of escaped allies will be
transported to Daydream Paradise.

15:25.830 --> 15:27.420
Please prepare for them.

15:28.000 --> 15:30.880
Kill Terakomari Gandesblood!

15:32.540 --> 15:34.380
Yeah!

15:34.750 --> 15:36.420
Those rusty bastards...

15:36.420 --> 15:38.170
We're going too!

15:40.040 --> 15:41.710
Huh? Wha?

15:41.830 --> 15:42.750
Uh...

16:02.580 --> 16:05.830
Terakomari Gandesblood!

16:07.880 --> 16:09.500
Lady Komari, it's a bomb.

16:09.500 --> 16:10.500
Whoa!

16:14.960 --> 16:16.710
A-are you all right?!

16:16.710 --> 16:18.000
Y-yeah...

16:21.420 --> 16:23.920
Komari! There you are!

16:23.920 --> 16:24.710
Nelia?!

16:34.790 --> 16:36.420
Where are we?

16:38.380 --> 16:39.710
Nelia!

16:39.710 --> 16:42.250
H-hey! Where is this?

16:42.250 --> 16:46.080
We should be close to
Daydream Paradise, but...

16:46.080 --> 16:49.920
Thanks to that idiot Madhart
destroying the transfer gate,

16:49.920 --> 16:52.580
it looks like we were sent to a place
that I don't know well.

16:53.290 --> 16:55.830
Don't be so guarded, Komari.

16:55.830 --> 16:57.710
I want you to listen to what I tell you.

16:57.710 --> 16:58.750
Tell me?

16:58.750 --> 17:03.880
You really do look like my teacher.

17:03.880 --> 17:06.500
Your teacher? And who is that?

17:06.500 --> 17:08.460
Your mother.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.080
Huh?

17:11.080 --> 17:14.750
She really taught me so much,

17:14.750 --> 17:18.170
including compassion towards others
and how to fight.

17:20.080 --> 17:21.580
Mom...

17:21.920 --> 17:26.210
She said you wouldn't remember, but I do.

17:26.210 --> 17:26.880
Eh?

17:26.880 --> 17:32.880
At the Mulnite Empire and Aruka Kingdom
joint exchange party, I met you...

17:33.460 --> 17:36.000
I had done something strange.

17:34.380 --> 17:38.920
<b>5 years ago</b>

17:45.540 --> 17:48.290
Your mom is really amazing, Komari.

17:48.290 --> 17:51.210
She's a great commander that's made
a name for herself in the Six Nations.

17:51.210 --> 17:53.000
Is she?

17:53.420 --> 17:55.170
I don't really know.

17:55.170 --> 17:56.830
She is!

17:56.830 --> 17:59.460
You're gonna be a commander
when you grow up too, right?

17:59.460 --> 18:00.750
Nope.

18:01.750 --> 18:05.330
I don't really like fighting.

18:05.330 --> 18:09.170
But you can't achieve world domination
if you don't fight, you know?

18:09.170 --> 18:11.210
World domination?

18:14.380 --> 18:18.130
Nah, I can take over the world
without fighting.

18:18.790 --> 18:19.960
How?

18:19.960 --> 18:23.380
If everyone gets along,
then the world will be at peace.

18:23.630 --> 18:25.960
That's world domination. Right?

18:27.210 --> 18:30.330
And I want to be your friend, too.

18:30.330 --> 18:31.630
O-oh.

18:31.630 --> 18:36.380
But... do people hate me or something?

18:36.380 --> 18:40.210
Of course they don't. I like you.

18:40.960 --> 18:43.000
You do? Good.

18:43.670 --> 18:47.380
I feel like me and you can be good friends!

18:48.330 --> 18:50.630
Yeah, me too.

18:52.960 --> 18:53.790
Ouch!

18:57.460 --> 18:59.790
Hey, what are you doing?!

18:59.790 --> 19:01.500
Your Highness, Nelia...

19:02.000 --> 19:05.330
Be careful with conspiring with vampires.

19:05.330 --> 19:07.380
Conspiring? I was just-

19:07.380 --> 19:11.500
What I'm saying is to be aware of
the strength of Warblades.

19:11.500 --> 19:12.330
Well, I...

19:12.330 --> 19:14.960
This is a party to make friends, right?

19:17.710 --> 19:20.460
You came all the way here
so you should make friends, right?

19:20.460 --> 19:23.580
It is very important to remain
faithful to one's principles.

19:23.580 --> 19:27.040
Originally, there was a rift
between the both of you.

19:27.040 --> 19:29.540
You're the one who made that rift,
aren't you, Mister?

19:36.630 --> 19:38.880
Let's be friends, Mister.

19:39.460 --> 19:42.540
If it's not fun,
then I'll give you my pudding.

19:42.540 --> 19:43.830
Pudding?

19:50.040 --> 19:51.710
I remember...

19:52.130 --> 19:54.330
You're the girl I ate pudding with.

19:56.670 --> 20:01.210
After that, I couldn't contact
my teacher for a while.

20:01.500 --> 20:02.540
Yeah.

20:03.130 --> 20:06.040
A coup d'état happened
in the Aruka Kingdom,

20:06.040 --> 20:10.460
and the former general Madhart
became the first president.

20:10.790 --> 20:12.170
And now...

20:12.170 --> 20:14.330
they're capturing resistance groups
one after another,

20:14.330 --> 20:17.380
and trying to start a war with
all Six Kingdoms involved.

20:17.920 --> 20:22.170
I'm no longer a royal,
but it'll just take a little time.

20:22.630 --> 20:26.580
I'll expose Madhart's evil ways,
and reform Aruka.

20:28.540 --> 20:32.040
I'll become president.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.630
President?

20:33.630 --> 20:36.380
I need your help for that.

20:36.380 --> 20:39.880
Komari, let's take over the world.

20:40.330 --> 20:42.500
Don't be deceived, Lady Komari.

20:43.210 --> 20:47.830
Vill, Nelia is a student of my mother.

20:47.830 --> 20:49.170
Lady Komari...

20:49.170 --> 20:51.790
I think I can trust her.

20:52.420 --> 20:55.000
Can we just go along with it this time?

20:55.000 --> 20:56.580
Understood.

20:56.580 --> 20:59.040
If you wish to do so, Lady Komari.

20:59.880 --> 21:00.750
Nelia.

21:00.750 --> 21:02.130
Thanks!
We're on your side.<b></b>

21:04.170 --> 21:05.420
Huh?

21:12.500 --> 21:14.250
Lady Komari?!

21:16.920 --> 21:19.830
This is an Arukan greeting.

21:20.880 --> 21:22.710
Ah, okay...

21:23.210 --> 21:25.000
A cultural difference, then.

21:25.000 --> 21:28.580
Lady Nelia! Aruka doesn't have
that sort of greeting!

21:28.580 --> 21:31.040
Refrain from touching Lady Komari.

21:31.040 --> 21:32.250
You'll get her all rusty.

21:32.250 --> 21:34.130
Ow, ow, ow! That's too tight!

21:34.130 --> 21:35.380
I'm sorry.

21:35.380 --> 21:38.540
By the way, is it all right if I try
the Arukan greeting?

21:38.540 --> 21:39.920
No, it's not all right!

21:41.040 --> 21:44.040
I knew being with Komari
would be entertaining!

21:44.460 --> 21:48.210
The Mul-Heav Alliance will
demolish Gerra-Aruka!

21:48.210 --> 21:51.250
To this end, will you
all become my servants?

21:51.250 --> 21:52.960
Of course we won't!

21:53.710 --> 21:56.080
What? Where is this?

21:57.580 --> 21:59.880
What was I doing?

22:00.630 --> 22:02.330
I don't recall...

22:03.250 --> 22:05.540
That damn Nelia... has she betrayed us?

22:06.080 --> 22:09.000
Lord Rainsworth. Should we storm Faure?

22:09.000 --> 22:12.630
No. We will follow Terakomari Gandesblood.

22:14.040 --> 22:18.880
Dear Nelia, be at the mercy of fate
and give up hope.

22:19.830 --> 22:24.290
Then you will be mine.

23:58.630 --> 24:01.040
<b>The Dream-Crushing Paradise</b>

23:58.920 --> 24:00.790
"The Dream-Crushing Paradise."
